     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par13/separator_copy_copy__2109892519"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_14"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Street Food at Temple Street Night Market</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_15"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>I always enjoy trying local dishes at Temple Street Night Market</li><li>Temple Spice Crabs is famous for its seafood selection, although my personal favorite is sweet and sour chicken</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_16"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Temple Street Night Market, Temple Street, Jordan",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_17"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Relax at Kowloon Park</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_18"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Between exploring the city, I like to take a break in Kowloon Park</li><li>The greenery and birdsong make you forget that you are in the middle of a busy metropolis</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_19"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Kowloon Park, 22 Austin Road, Tsim Sha Tsui",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_20"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_21"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par21/image_1420113679",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_bann-thai_c_jeremy-cheung_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Cozy seating area with cushions and warm lighting in the Baan Thai Restaurant"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Dinner at Baan Thai</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_22"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>The Thai cuisine at Baan Thai is one of my favorite dining experiences in Hong Kong</li><li>My tip: be sure to reserve a table in advance</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_23"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Baan Thai, 57 Wyndham Street, Central",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_24"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par24/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_skyline_getty1297741599_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Illuminated Hong Kong skyline at night with light beams over the harbor"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>A Symphony of Lights</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_25"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Every evening at 8 PM, the “A Symphony of Lights” show transforms Victoria Harbour into a spectacular display of light and color</li><li>It only lasts a few minutes but is an unforgettable experience</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_26"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "A Symphony of Lights, Victoria Harbour",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_27"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Live Music at The Iron Fairies</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_28"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>I love ending the day with live music at The Iron Fairies in Central</li><li>It is the perfect place to experience Hong Kong’s vibrant nightlife</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_29"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "The Iron Fairies, 1 Hollywood Rd, Central",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_30"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Copyrights:&nbsp;Unsplash / Bady Abbas, Jeremy Cheung (2), Getty Images (3)",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_31"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>About</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_32"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Katja Tucich has been with Lufthansa since 1999 and is a big fan of Hong Kong. The city has always been one of her favorite destinations, and she also enjoys going there for a personal trip with her daughter.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_33"
     }
    ],
